🗒️ Notes (Command Explanations)

- ping -n 1 -4 localhost  
  Confirms that the local network stack is functioning correctly by sending a single IPv4 ping to the machine itself.

- ping -n 1 -4 router.lan  
  Test's connectivity to the default gateway to verify that the device can reach the router and that the static IP configuration is valid.

- nslookup www.515web.net  
  Checks DNS resolution to ensure the system can successfully resolve external domain names beyond the local network.
